    "updated_at": "2026-07-22T17:51:33Z",
    "body": "I was changing the dashboard layout again, and after not having the ability in 2026 to have a mobile-ready layout, where I need to maintain at least two versions of the boards, and having constant battles with categories that always try to run away from the apps (though this specific issue seems to be resolved in 1.71.0), I decided that I would not use Homarr anymore.\n\nAs such, I am not as invested in doing implementation for this feature. But I still think that this is a valid suggestion, so I would leave this ticket open.",
